          "2026-11-02. All four sampled apo cases are identified; prepared CSV records and canonical input sources are pinned; all four native reference locations are pinned. All 85 inventoried remote files returned HTTP 200 to anonymous HEAD requests. The seed’s case count, kind and unit-probe description match the records. The requested MEGADOCK software pins are absent from the inspected run9 records, so software pin coverage is partial. FroDock distribution provenance remains `unverified_mirror`.\n",
          "Only `b01_materials/` was written. No workload, installation, pipeline change, GPU-box contact, outreach, commit, push, upload or full-file network download occurred. Earlier cache files and blind-01 records were read without modification. No credential, `.keys` file or `~/.codex/` path was read.\n",
